![Image may contain Adult Person Book Comics Publication Face Head and Stencil](https://media.pitchfork.com/photos/6aee2f97d19586adfe8e35cb/master/w_1600,c_limit/Bedhead%20%E2%80%94%20Transaction%20de%20Novo.jpg)

