Look, no one’s told me they went to Yale because of Dave Longstreth. Vampire Weekend remained synonymous with their alma mater long after all four members had turned their tassels, and Ezra Koenig in particular made for a note-perfect Ivy League pupil. A homegrown boy from just over the Hudson River, he followed the trade routes set out by [worldly](https://pitchfork.com/reviews/albums/16843-graceland-25th-anniversary-edition/) [white guys](https://pitchfork.com/reviews/albums/peter-gabriel-so/) before him, to Senegal and Johannesburg, to Dharamsala. Then he came back to his city.

