## Sonic Youth: Daydream Nation

![Image may contain Weapon and Stencil](https://media.pitchfork.com/photos/6aee2f96d1ad83d11d558086/master/w_1600,c_limit/Sonic%20Youth%20%E2%80%94%20Daydream%20Nation.jpg)

